    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. i tried bumping the temp to 205c and going to 45 seconds but the vibrancy is still dull and the edges are still kind of fuzzy. it's weird because the settings are standard for this fabric type. i also checked the pressure and it seems even across the plate. could it be something with the ink itself or how it's reacting to the heat? i feel like the color just isn't \"taking\" properly.",
