      "content": "yeah we checked the cotton vs poly content and it's definitely a high poly blend so that shouldn't be it. and the ink is a fresh batch. it's just really frustrating because it feels like the pigment just disappears or gets lost during the press. like it's there on the paper but when the heat hits it, it just doesn't settle into the fibers like it's supposed to. almost like something is interfering with the transfer process itself. any other technical reasons for that kind of loss?",
